// Modular override for potted plants, aka kirby plants, so we can add our own.

//// **Important points about this file** ////

// Plant icons need to be named plant-[number].
// If you increase the number of potted plants, you need to override kirbyplants.dm accordingly.
// Changing plant-25, plant-26 through -29, plant-09, or any of the specially named plants will also affect kirbyplants.dm.

/obj/item/kirbyplants
	icon = 'modular_horsetest/modules/decor/potted_plants/icons/potted_plants.dmi'
